= Short-Horizon Hospital Wait Forecasting in Resource-Constrained Settings
== Abstract
This work benchmarks lightweight forecasting methods for emergency wait-time prediction using small datasets. We package reproducible training, evaluation, and reporting suitable for continuous integration.

== Method
Compare baseline moving average vs gradient boosted regressor with lag features.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
